<title>USA: TABLE- Associates First Cap unit sells notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Associates First Cap unit sells notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Associates Corp was priced via a competitive bid on Tuesday, according to co-lead manager UBS Securites Inc.</p>
<p>Chase Securites Inc was also co-lead manager on the offering.</p>
<p>Associates Corp is a unit of Associates First Capital Inc, which is 80 percent owned by Ford Motor Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER ASSOCIATES CORP</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	 COUPON 6.50 PCT   MATURITY 7/15/2002</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.971  FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AA3   YIELD 6.507 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA-MINUS  SPREAD 35 BPS     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
</text>
